<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443352437"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:29.427"><div begin="0.837" end="5.422" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="0.837" end="5.422" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.837" end="1.585">Oh,</span> <span begin="1.585" end="2.697">ho</span><span begin="2.697" end="3.815">ney,</span> <span begin="3.815" end="5.132">mu</span><span begin="5.132" end="5.422">ah</span></p></div><div begin="22.500" end="46.264" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="22.500" end="25.434" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.500" end="24.435">怎么你今晚声线</span><span begin="24.435" end="24.852">尖</span><span begin="24.852" end="25.434">了</span></p><p begin="25.543" end="29.299" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.543" end="26.245">发型</span><span begin="26.245" end="27.679">又</span><span begin="27.679" end="28.062">乱</span><span begin="28.062" end="29.299">了</span></p><p begin="30.821" end="33.791" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.821" end="32.701">仿佛剧烈运动完</span><span begin="32.701" end="33.119">散</span><span begin="33.119" end="33.791">了</span></p><p begin="33.895" end="37.513" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.895" end="34.515">一</span><span begin="34.515" end="34.811">看</span><span begin="34.811" end="35.200">表</span><span begin="35.200" end="36.179">心里知</span><span begin="36.179" end="36.597">不</span><span begin="36.597" end="37.513">妙</span></p><p begin="39.118" end="41.554" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.118" end="40.800">这晚你去过那</span><span begin="40.800" end="41.050">里</span><span begin="41.050" end="41.554">吧</span></p><p begin="41.794" end="46.264" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.794" end="42.506">与那</span><span begin="42.506" end="42.906">个</span><span begin="42.906" end="43.374">他</span><span begin="43.374" end="44.424">静静弹着</span><span begin="44.424" end="44.874">旧</span><span begin="44.874" end="46.264">调</span></p></div><div begin="49.152" end="1:05.826" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="49.152" end="53.248" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.152" end="49.668">你坏</span><span begin="49.668" end="50.013">了</span> <span begin="50.169" end="50.399">说</span><span begin="50.399" end="50.938">大概</span><span begin="50.938" end="51.229">夜</span><span begin="51.229" end="51.607">了</span> <span begin="51.757" end="52.003">让你</span><span begin="52.003" end="52.541">秀发</span><span begin="52.541" end="52.858">乱</span><span begin="52.858" end="53.248">了</span></p><p begin="53.252" end="57.378" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.252" end="53.505">急急</span><span begin="53.505" end="54.122">撒娇</span> <span begin="54.385" end="54.850">背着</span><span begin="54.850" end="55.082">我</span><span begin="55.082" end="55.354">不</span><span begin="55.354" end="55.815">敢</span><span begin="55.948" end="56.431">轻佻</span> <span begin="56.431" end="56.991">玩够</span><span begin="56.991" end="57.378">了</span></p><p begin="57.494" end="1:01.500" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.494" end="58.013">请揭</span><span begin="58.013" end="58.387">晓</span> <span begin="58.532" end="58.838">你</span><span begin="58.838" end="59.553">做错事</span><span begin="59.553" end="59.929">了</span> <span begin="1:00.036" end="1:00.632">让你秀</span><span begin="1:00.632" end="1:00.883">发</span><span begin="1:00.883" end="1:01.149">乱</span><span begin="1:01.149" end="1:01.500">了</span></p><p begin="1:01.646" end="1:05.826" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.646" end="1:01.929">应对</span><span begin="1:01.929" end="1:02.211">乱</span><span begin="1:02.211" end="1:02.579">了</span> <span begin="1:02.765" end="1:02.962">太过</span><span begin="1:02.962" end="1:03.231">份</span><span begin="1:03.231" end="1:03.491">了</span> <span begin="1:03.491" end="1:03.697">恤</span><span begin="1:03.697" end="1:04.174">衫</span><span begin="1:04.319" end="1:05.117">反转</span><span begin="1:05.117" end="1:05.360">着</span><span begin="1:05.360" end="1:05.826">了</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.278" end="1:31.156" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:06.278" end="1:09.377" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.278" end="1:08.256">这些事差点不会</span><span begin="1:08.256" end="1:08.674">猜</span><span begin="1:08.674" end="1:09.377">到</span></p><p begin="1:09.957" end="1:13.187" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.957" end="1:10.151">但</span><span begin="1:10.151" end="1:10.766">你</span><span begin="1:10.766" end="1:11.584">对待我</span><span begin="1:11.584" end="1:11.985">太</span><span begin="1:11.985" end="1:13.187">好</span></p><p begin="1:14.601" end="1:17.646" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.601" end="1:16.601">偷欢后一般感到</span><span begin="1:16.601" end="1:16.984">焦</span><span begin="1:16.984" end="1:17.646">燥</span></p><p begin="1:17.719" end="1:21.519" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.719" end="1:18.218">需</span><span begin="1:18.218" end="1:18.570">要</span><span begin="1:18.570" end="1:19.293">找</span><span begin="1:19.715" end="1:20.271">出</span><span begin="1:20.271" end="1:21.519">路</span></p><p begin="1:22.969" end="1:25.433" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.969" end="1:24.875">这晚你对我说爱</span><span begin="1:24.875" end="1:25.433">慕</span></p><p begin="1:25.516" end="1:31.156" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.516" end="1:26.209">当作</span><span begin="1:26.209" end="1:26.659">恶</span><span begin="1:26.659" end="1:27.175">补</span><span begin="1:27.175" end="1:28.293">赎罪还是</span><span begin="1:28.293" end="1:28.763">问</span><span begin="1:28.763" end="1:31.156">路</span></p></div><div begin="1:32.996" end="1:49.777" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:32.996" end="1:37.033" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.996" end="1:33.512">你坏</span><span begin="1:33.512" end="1:33.857">了</span> <span begin="1:34.013" end="1:34.243">说</span><span begin="1:34.243" end="1:34.782">大概</span><span begin="1:34.782" end="1:35.073">夜</span